# env.optional — enrichment only; the skill runs fully (keyless) without these.
#
# Measured per-domain traffic / ranking keywords via scripts/paid_seo.py (DataForSEO,
# HTTP Basic auth). When set, per-pattern traffic upgrades from directional to "measured";
# absent -> directional from SERP probes (adapter exits gracefully, keyless flow continues):
DATAFORSEO_LOGIN
DATAFORSEO_PASSWORD
# Alternative paid providers (NOT implemented in paid_seo.py; out-of-band only):
SEMRUSH_API_KEY
AHREFS_API_TOKEN
SIMILARWEB_API_KEY
# Hostile-site crawl fallback (absent -> serp_probe + sitemap crawl):
APIFY_API_TOKEN
